{"4703560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soviet Backrooms", "steam_appid": 4703560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You remember this place.<br><br>The peeling walls.<br>The buzzing fluorescent lights.<br>The endless Soviet hallways that never seemed to end.<br><br>But you have never been here before.<br><br>Somewhere in the darkness, you hear footsteps behind you.<br><br>When you turn around, the corridor is empty.</i></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Backrooms</strong> is an atmospheric first-person survival horror game set inside a liminal nightmare of abandoned post-Soviet interiors, distorted memories, and oppressive silence.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore decaying apartments, forgotten stairwells, endless corridors, and dead spaces frozen somewhere between reality and a nightmare you cannot escape.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Soviet liminal nightmare</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/17b67d289a0f567b884c2107303d7dd2.poster.avif?t=1780565069\" width=616 height=303 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/17b67d289a0f567b884c2107303d7dd2.webm?t=1780565069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through unsettling environments inspired by post-Soviet architecture — dim Khrushchyovka hallways, abandoned buildings, flickering lights, cracked tiles, and suffocating silence.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location feels disturbingly familiar, like a forgotten memory that was never meant to return.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something is following you</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/a34d87badc7e406e36e71de5a6c2b0e3.poster.avif?t=1780565069\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/a34d87badc7e406e36e71de5a6c2b0e3.webm?t=1780565069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the world begins to change.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully.<br>The sounds behind you are getting closer.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive post-Soviet liminal environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on tension and immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned apartments, corridors, stairwells, and underground spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing atmosphere inspired by analog and liminal horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unseen threats stalking you through the silence</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are searching for a way out.<br><br>But this place does not want to let you leave.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You remember this place.<br><br>The peeling walls.<br>The buzzing fluorescent lights.<br>The endless Soviet hallways that never seemed to end.<br><br>But you have never been here before.<br><br>Somewhere in the darkness, you hear footsteps behind you.<br><br>When you turn around, the corridor is empty.</i></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Backrooms</strong> is an atmospheric first-person survival horror game set inside a liminal nightmare of abandoned post-Soviet interiors, distorted memories, and oppressive silence.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore decaying apartments, forgotten stairwells, endless corridors, and dead spaces frozen somewhere between reality and a nightmare you cannot escape.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Soviet liminal nightmare</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/17b67d289a0f567b884c2107303d7dd2.poster.avif?t=1780565069\" width=616 height=303 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/17b67d289a0f567b884c2107303d7dd2.webm?t=1780565069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through unsettling environments inspired by post-Soviet architecture — dim Khrushchyovka hallways, abandoned buildings, flickering lights, cracked tiles, and suffocating silence.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location feels disturbingly familiar, like a forgotten memory that was never meant to return.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something is following you</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/a34d87badc7e406e36e71de5a6c2b0e3.poster.avif?t=1780565069\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703560/extras/a34d87badc7e406e36e71de5a6c2b0e3.webm?t=1780565069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the world begins to change.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully.<br>The sounds behind you are getting closer.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive post-Soviet liminal environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror f